span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">amortized Bayesian inference.</span> </i></p><p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:16px;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"> </span></p><p style=\"margin:0in;font-size:16px;font-family:Aptos,sans-serif;color:rgb(33,33,33)\"><span style=\"font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\">More details on abstract submission and the pre- and post-conference workshops will follow soon. Keep an eye on the website for more information:</span> <span lang=\"EN-GB\" style=\"font-size:11pt;font-family:Calibri,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://eur04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url=http%3A%2F%2Fmultilevel.fss.uu.nl%2F&amp;data=05%...%40uva.nl%7Cc4d4c7c0047c4bff637808ddc5072095%7Ca0f1cacd618c4403b94576fb3d6874e5%7C0%7C0%7C638883356611531211%7CUnknown%7CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%3D%3D%7C0%7C%7C%7C&amp;sdata=GlCMHWWTIV98xwwhqA9KaMwB21pQVsgpHKpm7pJaWVQ%3D&amp;reserved=0\" title=\"Original URL:\r\nhttp://multilevel.fss.uu.nl/\r\n\r\nClick to follow link.\" style=\"color:rgb(150,96,125);text-decoration-line:underline\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://eur04.safelinks.protection.outlook.com/?url%3Dhttp%253A%252F%252Fmultilevel.fss.uu.nl%252F%26data%3D05%257C02%257Ct.d.jorgensen%2540uva.nl%257Cc4d4c7c0047c4bff637808ddc5072095%257Ca0f1cacd618c4403b94576fb3d6874e5%257C0%257C0%257C638883356611531211%257CUnknown%257CTWFpbGZsb3d8eyJFbXB0eU1hcGkiOnRydWUsIlYiOiIwLjAuMDAwMCIsIlAiOiJXaW4zMiIsIkFOIjoiTWFpbCIsIldUIjoyfQ%253D%253D%257C0%257C%257C%257C%26sdata%3DGlCMHWWTIV98xwwhqA9KaMwB21pQVsgpHKpm7pJaWVQ%253D%26reserved%3D0&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792412855244000&amp;usg=AOvVaw06dtqG7r7rlLeAUCe94L0v\"><span style=\"font-family:Aptos,sans-serif\">http://multilevel.fss.uu.nl/</span></a></span></p><br></div></div></blockquote></div>"
